# Copy this file to .env and fill it in:   cp .env.example .env
# (Or let the ElevenLabs CLI write the key to .env.local: npx -y @elevenlabs/cli@latest onboard connect --env-path .env.local)
# .env and .env.local are ignored by git and kept out of the Docker image. Never commit a real key.
#
# Speech to text on the phone page (its 🎤 button). Needs the internet, and only for this step:
# the birds themselves need none. Leave it empty and the button is hidden.
# Get a key at https://elevenlabs.io (profile > API keys). It only needs the Speech to Text permission.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Optional: the speech-to-text model (default scribe_v1).
# ELEVENLABS_STT_MODEL=scribe_v1
